OL,3,GNEWSAMP to challenge 'ill-thought'
OL,4,AShakespeare move
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe MP for Stratford-upon-Avon has
OL,7,Fdescribed plans to move the Shakespeare
OL,8,FInstitute to Birmingham as
OL,9,F"ill-thought" and "shocking".
OL,11,FThe postgraduate research institute is
OL,12,Fdue to leave its historic home at Mason
OL,13,FCroft and relocate to the University of
OL,14,FBirmingham's Edgbaston campus in
OL,15,FSeptember.
OL,17,FThe Liberal Democrat MP Manuela
OL,18,FPerteghella said she would raise the
OL,19,Fissue in parliament and write to the
OL,20,Funiversity about her "deep
OL,21,Fdisappointment" and concerns for the
OL,22,FInstitute's future.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
